WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Your life is not bad

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,480
They all ate high-end fruits that I didn’t recognize.

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,480
You did it on purpose?

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,520
I'm timid

5
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,440
Only dare to eat things you know

6
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,960
Eat the kind of healthy fruit that makes your face so sour

7
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,080
Still for the brave

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,260
Haven't you been staring at him all day?

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,940
This sweet potato puree is still wet.

10
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,180
The fruits are freshly picked too, don’t tell me.

11
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:25,560
These are the same things he did a few days ago

12
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,800
Aren’t you most afraid of being hungry?

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,880
No matter how unpalatable this fruit is

14
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,880
It can also fill the stomach

15
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,840
Why don't you take a bite? It's so sour that I can't eat it.

16
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:37,420
Sister Rouer insists that I eat it, so I’ll just let it go, right?

17
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,740
He's obviously hungrier than me

18
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,980
Why is it not miserable at all?

19
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,420
I have to ask tonight

20
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,140
Tomorrow we will start the round skating test

21
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,740
He can find sweet potato fruit

22
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,540
It means these places are all on the island

23
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,820
Why can't we find it?

24
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,340
But if he finds out we are following him, what should he do? Stay away.

25
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,420
We are not robbing, we are just finding a way

26
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,540
You can follow me if you want

27
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,540
Whoever causes the conflict first is responsible

28
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:56,700
I won't end it for you
